!! Proposed Definition of ''ca''

;__ca__ (PU): A time tense relation/direction. The meaning as a sumtcita is that the main bridi happens simultaneous to the attached sumti. Defaults to a perspective of present-tense, and can be used with a meaning similar to present-tense in natural languages, or as "concurrent with" or "at the same time as".
** Keywords: "now", "is", "-ing"

!! Examples of ''ca'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of '' ca ma     ''

;__ca ma__ (PU*): A cmavo compound time tense relation/direction. Asks with what the main bridi is concurrent, similar to English "when?". See entries (ca) and (ma).
** Keywords: "when"

!! Examples of '' ca ma     '' Usage

