!! Proposed Definition of ''pu''

;__pu__ (PU): before -- A time tense relation/direction. The meaning as a sumtcita is that the main bridi happens before the attached sumti. Defaults to a perspective of past-tense, and can be used with a meaning similar to past-tense in natural languages, or as "before".
** Keywords:

